    <div class="ownership-opener-lines">
      <p>Something broke at 3am. The page went out.</p>

      <p>How long between that page firing and it reaching the person who could actually fix the thing? Not the person on call. The person who knew.</p>

      <p>That gap is what this session closes.</p>
    </div>
