  <h2>Who it is for</h2>

  <p>Directors and VPs of engineering, and heads of platform, running somewhere between 100 and 1,000 engineers. It lands hardest if you are a year or two past a microservices migration, or partway into a service catalog rollout that stopped.</p>

  <p>Bring the people who can actually decide. The session is worth less with a room that has to go ask someone.</p>

  <h2>Format and price</h2>

  <p>Half a day, about four hours, remote. Up to 25 people.</p>

  <p><strong>$6,000 for the session.</strong> One fee, not per seat. Bring everyone who should be there.</p>

  <p>You pick the date.</p>

</div>

